      "content": "Under GDPR, your main priorities are obtaining explicit consent before collecting customers' email addresses and shipping details in Lyon, and providing clear, easy-to-understand privacy notices explaining exactly how you will use this data. You must also implement strict data security measures to protect this sensitive information from unauthorized access and allow customers to easily request deletion or correction of their data. Finally, since you are likely processing EU citizen data, you should appoint a Data Protection Officer if you are a non-EU entity, or ensure your local French DPO obligations are met if operating as a single EEA business.",
