    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that makes sense. i'm a bit worried though about data breaches—like if someone were to sneak into my system and grab all the customer info without me knowing. what kind of stuff should i be looking for to prevent that, and how do i handle it if something \"hidden\" or unauthorized actually happens?",
