      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok, so i need to be vigilant. but it feels like hackers or people stealing data are almost like ghosts or something, just lurking in the background of the website. is there a way to detect if someone is \"hiding\" in my database or doing sneaky things that don't trigger a normal alarm? like, what are the subtle signs of someone being untrustworthy or meddling with my files?",
